{'symbol': 'WY', 'date': '2023-02-09 18:32:00', 'title': 'WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY ANNOUNCES 5.6% DIVIDEND INCREASE', 'text': 'SEATTLE , FEB. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY\xa0(NYSE: WY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY BASE CASH DIVIDEND OF\xa0$0.19 PER SHARE ON THE COMMON STOCK OF THE COMPANY, REFLECTING A 5.6 PERCENT INCREASE FROM THE PRIOR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF $0.18 PER SHARE. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE IN CASH ON\xa0MARCH 17, 2023, TO HOLDERS OF RECORD OF SUCH COMMON STOCK AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0MARCH 3, 2023.'}